  "id": "tax.us.2025.rule.form1040-line2a",
  "notes": "Form 1040 line 2a successor for the bounded 2025 multi-family class: closed box-12 subtotal plus Path A (no-f1099int-tax-exempt=yes \u2192 INT contribution 0) or Path B (box-8 family closed \u2192 closed box-8 subtotal). Box-9 absence/zero is enforced at admission on each statement companion. Residual scope components remain unconditional yes. Historical @v1 (box-12-only with unconditional no-f1099int=yes) remains immutable. Line 2a is reported-but-not-directly-taxable and is never an input to line 9 or taxable-income arithmetic. Successor v3 drops the no-taxable-social-security residual because the bounded Social Security Benefits Worksheet now consumes line 2a; historical v1/v2 remain immutable.",
